      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "content": "\n**Instrumentation gap \u2014 do not interpret NO DATA as healthy.** The owned metrics store currently has no fleet Redfish/iDRAC collector. Only site-management IPMI sensors are present; they do not represent the 4,032 compute nodes.\n\nRequired collection contract: Redfish reachability, iDRAC license state, fan presence/RPM/health, inlet temperature, power state, timestamp, and per-node collection error. This dashboard is intentionally explicit until credentials and a bounded polling schedule are connected.\n",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "title": "BMC / iDRAC collection status",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "nvis-victoriametrics"
      },
      "description": "",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "decimals": 0,
          "noValue": "NO DATA",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short"
        },
